  "title": "[Study] Off-Highway Vehicle Deaths: ATV, ROV, and UTV Accidents",
  "excerpt": "Recreational use of off-highway vehicles (OHVs) is a favorite pastime for Americans across the nation. Despite their fun nature, the safety of OHVs have been heavily scrutinized as it remains a major cause of personal injury and deaths every year. With the ability to reach high speeds, a lack of safety equipment, and an uncontrolled […]",
  "publishedAt": "2024-12-05T11:12:33",
  "modifiedAt": "2026-01-29T11:45:17",
  "categories": [
    "personal-injury"
  ],
  "body": [
    {
