      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sahl",
          "text": "Recreational use of off-highway vehicles (OHVs) is a favorite pastime for Americans across the nation. Despite their fun nature, the safety of OHVs have been heavily scrutinized as it remains a major cause of ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sahn",
          "text": "personal injury",
          "marks": [
            "lahm"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saho",
          "text": " and deaths every year. With the ability to reach high speeds, a lack of safety equipment, and an uncontrolled environment, it’s easy to see why fatal incidents and resulting are so common.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "iahq",
      "src": "./images/2024-12-Study-of-OHV-fatalities.jpg",
      "alt": "study of ohv and atv fatalities"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bahs",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sahr",
          "text": "This analysis is based on data gathered by the CPSC and spans between 2018 to 2020. OHVs are divided into three categories:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bahv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saht",
          "text": "All-Terrain Vehicles (ATVs): ",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sahu",
          "text": "motorized off-road vehicles with three or more wheels, a seat, and handlebars for steering.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bahy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sahw",
          "text": "Recreational Off-Highway Vehicles (ROVs): ",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sahx",
          "text": "motorized off-road vehicles with 4 or more tires with side-by-side seating, and automotive-type controls. Recreational side-by-sides fall under this category.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bai1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sahz",
          "text": "Utility Terrain Vehicles (UTVs): ",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sai0",
          "text": "Defined using the same characteristics as ROVs, however, their maximum speed does not exceed 25-30mph and equipped with larger cargo beds.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bai3",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
