    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baik",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saij",
          "text": "Which Off-Highway Vehicle Type is Most Deadly?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "iail",
      "src": "./images/2024-12-Yearly-Deaths-by-OHV-Type.png",
      "alt": "yearly deaths by OHV type"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bais",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saim",
          "text": "ATVs are the most deadly type of off-highway vehicle accounting for ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saio",
          "text": "1,643 deaths",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saip",
          "text": ". On average, there are ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saiq",
          "text": "548 ATV deaths per year",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sair",
          "text": ". In 2020, there were a total of 633 fatalities, surpassing the previous years’ average by nearly 30%.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baiw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sait",
          "text": "The next leading vehicle type by fatalities is ROVs with 635 deaths, UTVs with 56, and 114 unknown (ROV or UTV). Combining these categories gives us a total of 805 side-by-side deaths, and an ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saiu",
          "text": "average of 268 side-by-side deaths per year.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baiy",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saix",
          "text": "Males Are Significantly More Likely to Die",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "iaiz",
      "src": "./images/2024-12-OHV-Fatalities-by-Gender.png",
      "alt": "OHV fatalities by gender, male and female"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baj1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saj0",
          "text": "Males are disproportionately represented in OHV-related fatalities. Of 2,448 deaths between 2018 and 2020, over 2,000 were males. This may likely be due to males taking heavier risks when operating an OHV compared to females.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baj3",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saj2",
          "text": "How Many ATV-Related Injuries Have Occurred?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "iaj4",
      "src": "./images/2024-12-Distribution-of-injuries-by-OHV-type.png",
      "alt": "Distribution of Injuries by OHV type"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baj6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saj5",
          "text": "There were 80,600 ATV related injuries that went treated by the emergency department. Out of all off-highway vehicles, ATVs accounted for 85% of total injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baj8",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saj7",
          "text": "Which Age Group Dies the Most on OHVs?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "iaj9",
      "src": "./images/2024-12-OHV-fatalities-by-age-group.png",
      "alt": "OHV fatalities by age group"
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saja",
          "text": "Riders aged 55 and up accounted for 740 OHV fatalities. OHV users in this age range are",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajb",
          "text": " 2.6x more likely to die",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajc",
          "text": " than any other age group.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajf",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saje",
          "text": "Most Common Causes of OHV Fatalities and Injuries",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajh",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajg",
          "text": "This study observed 6 of the most common hazards that lead to injuries and fatalities in all types of OHVs.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajj",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saji",
          "text": "Overturning",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajl",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajk",
          "text": "Also called “overturning,” overturns occur when the vehicle rolls forward, backward, sideways, or in an unknown direction. Forward and back overturns often occur when ascending or descending an incline. Sideways rollovers are often the result of a sharp turn typically caused by:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajn",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajm",
          "text": "Speed",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajo",
          "text": "Change in terrain type or angle",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajr",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajq",
          "text": "Improper load/lean",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajt",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajs",
          "text": "Overturns were the number one hazard for ATVs causing 38% of rider fatalities.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajv",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saju",
          "text": "Collisions",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajx",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajw",
          "text": "As the primary hazard in 37% of fatalities, collisions are another significant cause of ATV fatalities. Collision incidents generally involve vehicles colliding with stationary objects or with other vehicles.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajz",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajy",
          "text": "Ejections",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bak1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sak0",
          "text": "Ejections are the type of hazard most commonly related to OHV fatalities. For ROVs, over 80% of the fatally injured were ejected from the vehicle. Similarly, ATVs do not have safety restraints so victims of fatal incidents typically did not remain seated after an accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bak3",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sak2",
          "text": "Faulty Design",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bak8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lak5",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-product-liability-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sak4",
          "text": "In the late 1980s, manufacturers agreed to discontinue the production of 3-wheeled ATVs. It was determined that the 3-wheel design was unsafe after numerous fatalities. The inherent nature of 3 wheels made these vehicles especially prone to rollovers. If you or someone you love was injured by a faulty-designed OHV, consult with our ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sak6",
          "text": "Denver product liability attorney",
          "marks": [
            "lak5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sak7",
          "text": " to hold manufacturers accountable.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baka",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sak9",
          "text": "Other Causes Include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bakd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sakb",
          "text": "Drowning:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sakc",
          "text": " From falling into a body of water.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bakg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sake",
          "text": "Fire:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sakf",
          "text": " Typically from an ROV fire.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bakj",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sakh",
          "text": "Impalement:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saki",
          "text": " Debris penetrating an ROV or UTV",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
